&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Infrastructure Engineering team&lt;/strong&gt; enables Reddit to deliver Reliability, Performance, and Efficiency, with a single opinionated technology stack. We empower Reddit developers by delivering a reliable, scalable, and automated foundation - unifying compute, seamless deployments, robust storage, and high-performance messaging to maximize developer velocity and system resilience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This centralized role hires across several high-impact teams, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Messaging:&lt;/strong&gt; Delivers a reliable, performant, and efficient platform to support asynchronous communication across all products and services at Reddit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Site Defense:&lt;/strong&gt; Builds platforms that detect and mitigate bots, scraping, and abusive traffic while preserving a reliable experience for legitimate users across Reddit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Builds platforms for service identity, secrets management, and secure access that make Reddit’s infrastructure secure by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Product Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Product Management, Product Design, Data Science, and Client Engineers (iOS/Android/Web) to translate business and user needs into reliable, low-latency technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the full software lifecycle for major product initiatives from technical design docs and API contracts to development, testing, rollout, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; Experimentation-Led Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, and evaluate A/B experiments. Work with tools like BigQuery, HEX, or Firebase to analyze user behavior, conversion funnels, and retention loops to make data-backed engineering decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API &amp;amp; System Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain scalable APIs (GraphQL, REST, gRPC) and distributed backend services optimized for client consumption and consumer UI performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Rigor &amp;amp; Modern Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish engineering best practices, improve developer workflows, mentor teammates, and use modern, AI-integrated tools to ship high-quality products efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In your day-to-day, you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steer: Work with the team to select, scope, and drive high leverage projects that align with Reddit’s goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build: Execute on a strategy and create a more performant, more scalable, higher quality architecture around authentication, authorization and identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amplify: Mentor, coach, and collaborate with other technical contributors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate: Work together with a variety of cross functional teams across Reddit Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve: Learn and improve your own technical and non-technical abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you might be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience building internet-scale software, preferably with a focus on distributed systems infrastructure or infrastructure security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software development experience in one or more general purpose programming languages; Golang, Python, C++, Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with essential cloud infrastructure (Kubernetes, CI/CD, AWS, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing features, optimizations, and bug fixes to distributed messaging systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills to collaborate with stakeholders in engineering, data science, machine learning, and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science or equivalent technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Healthcare Benefits and Income Replacement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k with Employer Match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Planning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Vacation &amp;amp; Paid Volunteer Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job posting may span more than one career level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, this job is eligible to receive equity in the form of restricted stock units, and depending on the position offered, it may also be eligible to receive a commission. Additionally, Reddit offers a wide range of benefits to U.S.-based employees, including medical, dental, and vision insurance, 401(k) program with employer match, generous time off for vacation, and parental leave. To learn more, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.redditinc.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.redditinc.com/careers/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To provide greater transparency to candidates, we share base salary ranges for all US-based job postings regardless of state. We set standard base pay ranges for all roles based on function, level, and country location, benchmarked against similar stage growth companies. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors including, skills, depth of work experience and relevant licenses/credentials, and may vary from the amounts listed below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$164,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$229,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an AI Security Engineer to own the technical security controls for how Alpaca uses AI. The scope includes identity for AI agents and automations, security requirements for AI tools and integrations, guardrails, and security logging. You will also assist in developing AI-powered security tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will keep those controls consistent as AI adoption grows, and you will work with the teams building with AI so security is part of the design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Enterprise Security Architect and works closely with AI Enablement, Engineering, DevOps, GRC, and the wider Security team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Security Team is 100% distributed and remote.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You Get To Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The core responsibilities of the AI Security Engineer are focused on AI access controls, secure AI platforms, guardrails, visibility into AI usage, and AI-powered security tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Identity and Access Controls:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent Identity: Define how AI agents, bots, and automations authenticate, what they can access, and how their actions are attributed and audited.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool Access: Own security requirements for AI tool integrations, including least-privilege access and credential handling.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Assistant Controls: Define and enforce security settings for approved AI tools, including data handling and access policy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Least Privilege: Limit each agent and integration to the access it needs, and review that access when the integration changes.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure AI Platform, Tooling, and Response:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Requirements: Define security requirements for internal AI applications, including identity, data handling, secrets, and review of new integrations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guardrails: Design and implement guardrails for AI applications and agents.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Reviews: Review new AI applications and integrations for security risks, and give builders clear, practical requirements.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Tooling: Assist Security Operations in developing AI-powered tooling that supports detection, investigation, and response work.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safe Use in Security: Apply the same identity, data handling, and logging requirements to security team AI tools as to the rest of the company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Telemetry Requirements: Define the security logging AI systems must produce, and work with Security Operations on detection.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approved Use: Maintain visibility into AI tool usage and confirm it follows approved configurations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Support: Lead the AI-specific aspects of security incidents, such as agent misuse or data exposure through AI tools.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Call: Participate in the Security Operations on-call rotation after onboarding and cross-training.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standards: Turn AI security standards into technical controls.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRC Partnership: Partner with GRC on AI governance and provide technical evidence for control design.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Must-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited about Alpaca’s mission and what we’re building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in security engineering, application security, or cloud security roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience securing LLM applications, AI agents, or AI developer tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of AI-specific risks, such as prompt injection, data leakage, excessive agency, and insecure tool use (for example, the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity and access controls for services and non-human identities, including OAuth, service accounts, and secrets management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience in Python or another general-purpose language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD security checks and cloud-native deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with security operations or incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, especially when explaining risk to non-security builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working cross-functionally and making pragmatic security decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to participate in an on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI-assisted workflows for security operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building security telemetry for AI systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Might Be&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves):&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing financial, trading, or other highly regulated platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing enterprise AI coding tools and AI integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with policy-as-code and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI governance frameworks, such as the NIST AI Risk Management Framework or ISO 42001&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance security rigor with operational efficiency and business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://files.alpaca.markets/disclosures/AlpacaRecruitmentPrivacyPolicy.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an IT Security Engineer to own the security standards and controls that protect Alpaca’s workforce identities, endpoints, and critical business systems. The scope includes identity and access management, single sign-on, privileged access, multi-factor authentication, endpoint security, secure network access, and email security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will maintain those standards, measure how the controls are working, and partner with IT, who run devices and day-to-day administration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Enterprise Security Architect and works closely with IT, DevOps, Engineering, GRC, and the wider Security team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Security Team is 100% distributed and remote.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You Get To Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The core responsibilities of the IT Security Engineer are focused on identity security, endpoint security, email and domain protection, and measurable control enforcement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity and Access Security:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IAM and SSO Standards: Define and maintain security standards for SSO and conditional access across cloud, SaaS, and internal systems.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Factor Authentication: Own multi-factor authentication standards, including phishing-resistant methods, and keep them enforced.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privileged Access: Maintain privileged-access standards, approval policies, and periodic access reviews with system owners.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joiner, Mover, Leaver: Partner with IT and People teams so access changes are timely, complete, and auditable.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endpoint, Email, and Domain Security:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EDR Policy: Own endpoint detection and response policy and tuning, with IT handling deployment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Device Posture: Maintain device-posture and secure network access requirements for access to business applications.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control Measurement: Measure identity and endpoint controls and follow up where they are not met.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection Partnership: Work with Security Operations on identity, endpoint, and email detections and response playbooks.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Admin Access: Maintain security baselines for administrator access to critical SaaS platforms and vendor accounts.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Security Events: Assess the identity and account impact when a SaaS provider or vendor reports a security event.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email Security: Own email authentication standards and email security configuration.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Protection: Maintain security standards for company domains and for monitoring lookalike domains.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phishing Response: Triage reported phishing and coordinate takedowns.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Response and Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Support: Lead the identity, endpoint, and email aspects of security incidents, including account containment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Call: Participate in the Security Operations on-call rotation after onboarding and cross-training.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement: Give IT and employees clear guidance on security requirements, so controls are adopted without slowing the business.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Must-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited about Alpaca’s mission and what we’re building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in IT security, identity security, or security engineering roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with an identity provider and SSO, including SAML and OIDC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience enforcing phishing-resistant MFA, such as FIDO2 or hardware security keys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with an endpoint detection and response platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting or automation experience (Python, Bash, or PowerShell)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with zero-trust network access or device-posture controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of email authentication (SPF, DKIM, DMARC) and phishing response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with IT teams and translating security requirements into operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience investigating identity, endpoint, or email security alerts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to participate in an on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, especially during incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working cross-functionally and handling escalations calmly and decisively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Might Be&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves):&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
